</Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="403" width="300">
<Text color="#141B26FF" fontSize="13.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="这个锚点会被判为「暂挂」" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="34" top="430" width="340">
<Text color="#43536BFF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="暂挂 = 不计费、不判责，也不会算进 10 个可比锚点。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="34" top="448" width="340">
<Text color="#43536BFF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="但如果它在 10-07 前补拍成功，就回到正常差分。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="22" top="485.5" width="376" height="1">
<Container color="#DED7CBFF" width="376" height="1" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="22" top="500" width="80">
<Text color="#8494A8FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="重拍期限" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="104" top="494" width="80">
<Text color="#141B26FF" fontSize="20.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="-0.5" text="10-07" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="190" top="502" width="208">
<Text color="#8494A8FF" fontSize="10.5" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" text="还有 7 天 · 逾期则本锚点从结算表移除" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="22" top="534" width="120">
<Text color="#141B26FF" fontSize="13.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" text="怎么拍才过" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="24" top="561" width="3" height="14">
<Container color="#E08A0BFF" borderRadius="1.5" width="3" height="14" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="36" top="558" width="190">
<Text color="#141B26FF" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="关掉手电，改用侧光" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="236" top="559" width="160">
<Text color="#8494A8FF" fontSize="10.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="正对地漏打光会让不锈钢盖面全反光" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="24" top="582" width="3" height="14">
<Container color="#1E4FD8FF" borderRadius="1.5" width="3" height="14" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="36" top="579" width="190">
<Text color="#141B26FF" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="蹲下来，让地漏占画面 1/4" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="236" top="580" width="160">
<Text color="#8494A8FF" fontSize="10.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="标记牌只有 26mm，占比不足识别不到" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="24" top="603" width="3" height="14">
<Container color="#1E4FD8FF" borderRadius="1.5" width="3" height="14" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="36" top="600" width="190">
<Text color="#141B26FF" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" softWrap="false" text="先拍一张有牌的空地面" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="236" top="601" width="160">
